  "step_3": "The decision reason requires comparing the variance of the two lotteries and preferring the one with higher variance. However, the individual’s justification was based on the higher monetary amount and the similarity of probabilities, not on the spread or variability of outcomes. The individual did not refer to or consider variance in any form. The reported reasoning aligns more with a focus on expected value or maximum payoff, not variance. Therefore, the decision reason (preferring higher variance) was not used. There is no indication in the verbal report that the individual considered or evaluated the variance of the lotteries.",
